 KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md                                | 3 ++-
 csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_default.conf | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md b/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
index 5a7256c..9dedc39 100644
--- a/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
+++ b/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
@@ -92,13 +92,14 @@ Config files are located in `csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/`.
 | File | Kernels | Use Case |
 |------|---------|----------|
 | `paged_decode_full.conf` | 384 | All combinations — supports every model |
-| `paged_decode_default.conf` | ~17 | Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek MLA, Falcon (default build) |
+| `paged_decode_default.conf` | ~19 | Llama, Qwen, Laguna, DeepSeek MLA, Falcon (default build) |
 
 ### Recommended Config per Model Family
 
 | Model Family | head_size | Chunk Prefill | Paged Decode |
 |--------------|-----------|---------------|--------------|
 | Llama-2/3, Qwen, Mistral | 128 | `default` | `default` |
+| Laguna S 2.1 | 128 | `default` | `default` |
 | DeepSeek-V2/V3/R1 (MLA) | 192 | `default` | `default` |
 | Gemma-2 | 256 | `full` | `full` |
 | Mixed / other models | multiple | `full` | `full` |
diff --git a/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_default.conf b/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_default.conf
index 603f508..72a4093 100644
